s10:s1,s8,s3,i9:syl3anc |- ( ( C e. RR /\ N e. ( ZZ>= ` 3 ) /\ E e. RR ) -> ( ( C yscaleE N ) ` E ) = ( Nceil ` ( ( C zscale N ) ^c ( 1 - E ) ) ) )
i11::zscalecl
